    "created_at": "2020-11-06T10:09:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-11-06T10:09:16Z",
    "body": "This happens because the zsh init script sets `STARSHIP_SHELL` to `zsh` which causes some of the output of starship to be escaped for that shell.\r\nYou should have your `nu` initscript unset the  `STARSHIP_SHELL` variable or set it to `nu`. `STARSHIP_SHELL='nu' echo $(starship prompt)` might work?\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
